
Message Mapping ->
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 This is a type of mapping that transforms the structure and content of a message from one format to another.
 For example, you can map an XML message to a JSON message or vice versa. You can use message mapping in
 scenarios where you need to convert the message format between different systems or protocols.
 You can create message mappings using graphical, XSLT or Groovy tools.

